  Jamieson is taking flight with his PJ Air tour - bringing songs of triump
 h\, joy\, heartache and bluster to the edges of Australia.\n\nExperience o
 ne of Australia's most revered frontmen in an intimate setting as he navig
 ates the turbulence of life through a rejuvenated creative lens.\n\nYour s
 eat on PJ Air is waiting. Boarding starts at 9am on April 13th\, 2026.
