BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Civic Video
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260529T200000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260530T040000
UID:fun-time-pony-1d36d2ba19ed0ff4548910bb92778f5f
DESCRIPTION:Civic Video is a Sydney-based indie rock trio made up of Zac N
 ewton-John\, Belle Whitwell\, and Riley Maher. Their sound blends the shim
 mering\, expansive textures of Spacey Jane and Holy Holy with the lyrical 
 depth of Sam Fender\, creating a modern nostalgia anchored in emotive\, ho
 ok-driven indie rock.\n\nThe result is music that feels both familiar and 
 fresh — built on soaring melodies\, reflective storytelling\, and a dist
 inctly contemporary edge.
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://res.cloudinary.com/dxzcb4vmj/image/upload/v1779858
 964/Civic_Video_Canberra_45_xiwil7.png
LOCATION:Fun Time Pony\, 2/122 Alinga St\, Canberra ACT 2601
ORGANIZER:Fun Time Pony
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
